rc=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">What materials are best for outdoor kitchens in Florida?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">We install outdoor kitchens using weatherproof polymer cabinets, marine-grade stainless steel hardware, and natural stone countertops — all selected for resistance to Florida's heat, humidity, and coastal salt air. Every material choice is engineered to maintain its appearance and structural integrity over the long term.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bcf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">How long does outdoor construction usually take?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Outdoor kitchen installation timelines vary by scope and permit requirements, but most Florida projects are completed within weeks of final approval. Mr. &amp; Mrs. Outdoor Living manages the full permitting process — including HOA and ARB submissions — so construction begins without unnecessary delays.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bd7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Can I add a bar, pizza oven, or smoker to my kitchen?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Absolutely. Custom outdoor kitchens can be designed around any combination of cooking equipment including built-in bars, pizza ovens, smokers, kamado grills, and beverage refrigerators. Each specialty appliance is engineered into the layout with proper utility routing, ventilation, and structural support to meet Florida building code requirements.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077bdf\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Does an outdoor kitchen increase home value in Florida?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">Yes. Custom outdoor kitchens deliver strong return on investment in Florida real estate. Buyers in competitive South Florida markets view outdoor kitchens as a premium lifestyle feature. Well-designed, permitted kitchen installations can recover up to 80% of construction costs and meaningfully accelerate the sale of a Florida property.</p></nav></div><div data-delay=\"0\" data-hover=\"false\" data-w-id=\"9f159d33-eb67-9087-202c-bab1e4077be7\" class=\"dropdown-faq w-dropdown\"><div class=\"dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle\"><div class=\"block-arrow-faq\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/close-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-close\" width=\"7\" height=\"12\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/images/site/open-toggle.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"icon-dropdown-open\" width=\"12\" height=\"7\"></div><h3 class=\"dropdown-text\">Are outdoor kitchen appliances weatherproof?</h3></div><nav class=\"dropdown-list w-dropdown-list\"><p class=\"grey\">We specify and install appliances designed exclusively for outdoor kitchen use, ensuring durability, compliance with Florida building codes, and reliable performance in South Florida's heat and humidity. From professional-grade grills and smokers to outdoor-rated refrigerators and ice makers, every appliance is selected for longevity and ease of use.</p></nav></div></div></div><img sizes=\"100vw\" srcset=\"/images/site/design2-p-500.webp 500w, /images/site/design2-p-800.webp 800w, /images/site/design2-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/site/design2-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/site/design2.webp 1920w\" alt=\"\" src=\"/images/site/design2.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"design-bg\" width=\"1920\" height=\"146\"></section></div><section class=\"location\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7be\" class=\"header-location\"><h2>Where We Serve</h2><p>Regional Coverage With National Vision</p></div></div><div class=\"cms-country w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"cms-list-country w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-country w-dyn-item\"><img src=\"/images/where-we-serves/custom-pool-builders-north-florida/service-areas-north-south-florida-pools.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Service areas map showing North Florida coverage for luxury custom pool builders and outdoor living services.\" class=\"full-image-background\" width=\"1250\" height=\"938\"><div data-w-id=\"dfdd7317-58e7-27b3-99a6-2c20a5e8a7c8\" class=\"block-info-country\"><h3 class=\"white\">North Florida</h3><p>Licensed luxury pool builders in North Florida specializing in custom inground pools and outdoor living design-build projects, engineered for structural integrity and long-term durability.</p><a href=\"/where-we-serve/north-florida\" class=\"button button-styles w-button\">View North Florida Service Areas</a></div></div><div role=